            {
              "type": "title",
              "value": "⬆️ANZ Host SPECIAL Auto Rebate ⬆️"
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "June's auto reward giveaways continue and level-up! 🥳\n🔥More Chances, Higher Rebate! 🔥 \nGo Live now and unlock Beans Back!\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "📅 Event run dates: June 18-27\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⏰ Event run time: 1:00 PM - 4:00 PM AEST"
            },
            {
