              "type": "text",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "🟡 Rewards Structure "
            },
            {
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Level 1: if 800 beans received, get 250 beans reward;\n\nLevel 2: if 1,500 beans received, get extra 250 beans;\n\nLevel 3: if 2,500 beans received, get extra 350 beans;\n\nLevel 4: if 3,600 beans received, get extra 350 beans;\n\nLevel 5: if 4,800 beans received, get extra 400 beans;\n\nLevel 6: if 6,000 beans received, get extra 500 beans;\n\nLevel 7: if 9,000 beans received, get extra 900 beans;\n\nLevel 8: if 12,000 beans received, get extra 1,000 beans;\n\nLevel 9: if 16,000 beans received, get extra 1,600 beans;\n\nLevel 10: if 21,000 beans received, get extra 1,900 beans;\n\nThe maximum you can get is 7500 beans!"
            },
            {
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "💃 Go live in Solo or Multiguest Room as a host at least 20 mins within the hour, and you can do all event formats you like!"
            }
          ]
